, flexible alien arms to swing swiftly across psychedelic alien worlds. See if you can master the art of alien locomotion and become the top tagger in the galaxy. With Mods & Custom Maps natively integrated, no two games of Alien Tag are ever the same. Challenge your friends to out-swing and out-tag one another in intense, fast-paced rounds. Transport yourself to new worlds and catch some alien vibes today!", "short_description": "Reject Monke, Become Alien. Discord.gg/AlienTag. AlienTagVR.com."}]}, "developer_name": "IRLDLC.COM INC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://alientagvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IRLDLC.COM INC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://alientagvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28722342947364793"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031578_1564064461164663_2854215056481622770_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cQ8aOgyAowgQ7kNvwHy34Z0&_nc_oc=Adk4Y7RlaXJ6UaUSUCwwEuBoPKAaudv0Sy6SrzdScksToWKPG69Mhs40R--95yZeSKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzY78ZlbkNUs1RgNcZkvrZn6O4b1M4TEDWL5XitGm9B2A&oe=69B163BF"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Alien T